      "en": "Southern dining secret: Always wrap B\xE1nh X\xE8o inside broad Mustard Green leaves (L\xE1 c\u1EA3i xanh)! The wasabi-like herbal punch cuts right through the rich coconut pork oils with thrilling balance.",
