            "en": "\u3010Air Fryer Crisp\u3011: Lightly brush rolls with vegetable oil. Air fry at 180\xB0C (350\xB0F) for 12 mins, flip and blast at 200\xB0C (400\xB0F) for 3 mins until golden and blistered.",
            "vi": "\u3010N\u1ED3i chi\xEAn kh\xF4ng d\u1EA7u\u3011: Qu\xE9t m\u1ED9t l\u1EDBp d\u1EA7u \u0103n m\u1ECFng l\xEAn v\u1ECF nem. N\u01B0\u1EDBng \u1EDF 180\xB0C trong 12 ph\xFAt, l\u1EADt m\u1EB7t n\u01B0\u1EDBng ti\u1EBFp \u1EDF 200\xB0C trong 3 ph\xFAt cho v\u1ECF ph\u1ED3ng gi\xF2n r\u1EE5m.",
