        "en": "Garnish with a generous tablespoon of crushed roasted peanuts, scallions, and chili slices. Take a crisp black sesame rice cracker (B\xE1nh Tr\xE1ng M\xE8) and snap it directly over the bowl with your hands into crunchy bite-sized shards. Squeeze fresh lime, toss thoroughly, and savor the glorious interplay of silky noodles and shattering sesame crunch!",
